@startuml
title UC-03＋UC-04 出场设计顺序图（AI-辅助）
actor 车主
participant "AccessService" as access
participant "SpaceClient" as space
participant "PassClient" as pass
participant "BillingClient" as billing
database "parking_access" as db
车主 -> access : exit-requests(sessionId, exitTime)
access -> pass : eligibility(plate,entry,exit,type,sessionId)
access -> space : settlement(spaceId,sessionId)
note right of space : 无 ACTIVE 充电时冻结费用快照\n冻结后禁止新增充电
space --> access : chargingCents 或 STATE_CONFLICT
access -> db : 原子保存 exit_intent 并置 EXIT_PENDING_PAYMENT
access -> billing : createBill(sessionId,时间,权益,充电)
alt billing 暂不可用
  billing --> access : DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE
  access --> 车主 : 保留原出场意图，稍后重试
else 出账成功
  billing --> access : billId, amountDueCents, prepaidRefundCents
  access -> db : 保存 billId
end
access --> 车主 : 账单摘要（出账成功时）
opt 已生成账单，车主请求完成出场
车主 -> access : complete-exit(SUCCESS/FAILURE)
opt 有效月卡且账单未付
  access -> pass : deduct(monthlyPassId,amountDueCents)
end
access -> billing : pay(billId,模拟结果/余额来源)
billing --> access : PAID 或 UNPAID
alt 已支付
  access -> db : UPDATE PAID_PENDING_RELEASE
  opt 预约预付有差额
    access -> pass : refund-remainder(reservationId,sessionId)
  end
  access -> space : release(spaceId,sessionId)
  access -> db : UPDATE CLOSED
end
end
@enduml
